# Public build-time value (NOT a secret): the deployed backend API base.
# Vite inlines this during `vite build`, so the Vercel frontend knows where the
# API lives. Committed on purpose so the production build is reproducible.
# Permanent DuckDNS hostname: survives an Oracle VM IP change (the box keeps the
# DNS record current), so this value never needs to change again.
VITE_API_URL=https://agentiq.duckdns.org/api
